  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo nabatomwa bande",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’emiaka ikomi na ene ngatiira naende kogenda Yerusalemu amo na Barnaba, nkairana Tito agende amo nainche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inche ngatiira ekiagera namaanoreretwe na Nyasae buna ngende; ase obobisi nkabateebia abarai enchiri eria nkorandia ase abanto b’Ebisaku. Inche tinarigetie emeremo yane emekoro gose emeyia ebe bosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Tito oyorenge amo nainche, nonya orenge Omogiriki, tabetereretigwe kwarokigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nigo aganetigwe nabaminto buna akoreke. Abaminto b’oborimo, abasoetigwe bobisi, banyare kounenkia obosibore bwaito tore nabwo ime ase Kristo Yeso, erinde batobeke ase obosibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende erinde ekeene gi’enchiri kegenderere amo nainwe titwebegete inse ase bare nonya nensa eyemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abwo baabarire ng’a nabanene bare (tari gento ase ’nde nonya barenge nobonene bore naki; Nyasae tari nogwanchereria ase Mwanyabaanto), nakwanire ng’a abwo baabarire ng’a nabanene bare tibamentereti gento ase ’nde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende bakarora ekeene, ng’a inche negenirwe koranderia abatarogeti enchiri, buna Petero egenetwe koyeranderia baria baarogete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Naki ere oyoete Petero chinguru koba omotomwa bw’abaarogete, nere ong’ete inche chinguru koba omotomwa bw’abaanto b’Ebisaku.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende ekero bachia komanya obuya boria naeirwe, Yakobo na Kefa, na Yohana, abasikire bare buna chisiiro, bagatoa inche na Barnaba okoboko gw’okorio gw’okobwatana, erinde intwe togende ase abanto b’Ebisaku, na barabwo bagende ase abanto b’okwaroka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana erimo barigetie tokore nario eri, ng’a toinyore abataka, ne ring’ana erio nigo narenge nomokia korikora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo ogotogonyera Petero ase Antiokia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero Kefa achete Antiokia, nkaamererania nere obosio ase obosio, ekiagera konya oikire kogambigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki konya bataracha abanto baria barwete ase Yakobo, nigo arenge koragera amo nabaanto b’Ebisaku; korende ekero bachete akairana magega, ageatanana, akairoka abaarogete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo amo nere Abayahudi bande bagakora obong’ainereria boria, erinde nonya Barnaba agasirigwa nobong’ainereria bwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero nachia korora ng’a ogokora kwabo tikware okwaboronge ase ekeene gi’enchiri, ngateebia Kefa ase amasio y’abaanto bonsi, “Onye aye, oyore Omoyahudi, gokobwatia chingencho chi’abaanto b’Ebisaku, gose tari echi’Abayahudi, naki rende oranyare kobetereria abanto b’Ebisaku babwatie chingencho chi’Abayahudi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abayahudi n’Abanto b’ebisaku nigo bagotorigwa ase okwegena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intwe n’Abayahudi ase okoiborwa gwaito, gose tari abanyene ebibe b’Ebisaku,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende ntomanyete ng’a omonto takonyora oboronge ase ogokora kw’amachiiko, korende ase okomwegena Kristo Yeso. Nonya nintwe twamwegenire Kristo Yeso, erinde tonyore oboronge ase okomwegena Kristo, tari ase ogokora kw’amachiiko, ekiagera ase ogokora kw’amachiiko onde tari ase Mwanyabaanto oranyare konyora oboronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye intwe abanyene nigo twarenge korigia konyora oboronge ase Kristo, naende twanyoretwe tore abanyene ebibe, Inee, Kristo nabeire omosomba bw’ebibe? Yaya, taibo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende kondaagache naende aria natagorete, neorokirie inche omonyene ng’a nomomochi inde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki inche goetera ase amachiiko nakwereire amachiiko, erinde imbe moyo ase Nyasae. Nabambirwe na Kristo ase omosalaba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gose bono tari inche inde moyo, korende Kristo nigo are moyo ime ase ’nde; na obogima inde naborobwo bono ase omobere, nigo inde naborobwo ase okomwegena Omwana o Nyasae, oyonyanchete, naende bweruete omonyene ase engencho yane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinkwanga obuya bwa Nyasae, ekiagera onye oboronge bokonyorekana ase amachiiko, rirorio Kristo nigo akwete bosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
